    "complexity": "Complex",
    "description": "The voices of the nameless dead intrude into the minds of the living.",
    "disable": "DC 26 Perception to discern a name spoken by the nameless dead, or DC 28 Religion (expert) to put the nameless dead to rest. Speaking three names aloud disables the haunt. A creature that speaks any other name aloud must succeed at a DC 28 Will save or be confused for 1 round.",
